    ('inner-child', 'Inner child', 'The part that still reacts as a child', 'jungian', 'shadow', E'A part of anyone carries the reactions of a much smaller person — the one who was not equipped, and who had no available adult to hand it to. That is not damage and not blame. It is the ordinary arithmetic of being small once.\n\nNothing here is about what anyone did or did not do. Everyone in this has one; the only question is how much of it is currently in charge.', '🧸', 6, 7, '[{"id":"child-age","type":"choice","prompt":"When something lands, how old do you feel?","domain":"age","options":[{"label":"I do not notice it happening","value":"I do not notice it happening","weights":{"unexamined":1,"recognised":0,"soothed":0,"reparented":0}},{"label":"Somewhere younger, and I only notice afterwards","value":"Somewhere younger, and I only notice afterwards","weights":{"unexamined":0.25,"recognised":0.75,"soothed":0,"reparented":0}},{"label":"Somewhere between six and twelve","value":"Somewhere between six and twelve","weights":{"unexamined":0,"recognised":0.5,"soothed":0.5,"reparented":0}},{"label":"I can name the age and what was missing then","value":"I can name the age and what was missing then","weights":{"unexamined":0,"recognised":0,"soothed":0.75,"reparented":0.25}},{"label":"I can feel the age arriving and still be an adult inside it","value":"I can feel the age arriving and still be an adult inside it","weights":{"unexamined":0,"recognised":0,"soothed":0,"reparented":1}}]},{"id":"child-need","type":"choice","prompt":"When the small part shows up, what is it after?","domain":"need","options":[{"label":"I do not know, I just go low","value":"I do not know, I just go low","weights":{"unexamined":1}},{"label":"Quiet — I need the room to stop","value":"Quiet — I need the room to stop","weights":{"recognised":1}},{"label":"To be held, and told it was not anybody’s fault","value":"To be held, and told it was not anybody’s fault","weights":{"soothed":1}},{"label":"To be met — the same thing, from someone who can actually do it now","value":"To be met — the same thing, from someone who can actually do it now","weights":{"reparented":1}}]},{"id":"child-picture","type":"choice","prompt":"How clearly can you picture the one who reacts?","domain":"recognition","options":[{"label":"Not at all — I know it happens and nothing else","value":"Not at all — I know it happens and nothing else","weights":{"recognised":0}},{"label":"A general sense of how old it is","value":"A general sense of how old it is","weights":{"recognised":0.25}},{"label":"A rough picture, more often than not","value":"A rough picture, more often than not","weights":{"recognised":0.5}},{"label":"Clearly, most of the time","value":"Clearly, most of the time","weights":{"recognised":0.75}},{"label":"So clearly that I can hear what they would have said","value":"So clearly that I can hear what they would have said","weights":{"recognised":1}}]},{"id":"child-origin","type":"choice","prompt":"How much do you know about where these reactions came from?","domain":"origin","options":[{"label":"No idea, and I have not wanted to look","value":"No idea, and I have not wanted to look","weights":{"unexamined":0}},{"label":"Vaguely, mostly inferred","value":"Vaguely, mostly inferred","weights":{"unexamined":0.25}},{"label":"In broad strokes","value":"In broad strokes","weights":{"unexamined":0.5}},{"label":"In detail","value":"In detail","weights":{"unexamined":0.75}},{"label":"In enough detail that I understand what the reaction is protecting","value":"In enough detail that I understand what the reaction is protecting","weights":{"unexamined":1}}]},{"id":"child-release","type":"choice","prompt":"When the small part shows up, what happens next?","domain":"release","options":[{"label":"I bury it and get on with the day","value":"I bury it and get on with the day","weights":{"soothed":0}},{"label":"I get irritated with myself","value":"I get irritated with myself","weights":{"soothed":0.25}},{"label":"I feel it and hold very still","value":"I feel it and hold very still","weights":{"soothed":0.5}},{"label":"I let it move through without arguing with it","value":"I let it move through without arguing with it","weights":{"soothed":0.75}},{"label":"I take it seriously and answer it, as an adult would","value":"I take it seriously and answer it, as an adult would","weights":{"soothed":1}}]},{"id":"child-permission","type":"choice","prompt":"How much of what you want today would you have allowed a child to want?","domain":"permission","options":[{"label":"I would have told a child to wait","value":"I would have told a child to wait","weights":{"reparented":0}},{"label":"Some of it, once they were older","value":"Some of it, once they were older","weights":{"reparented":0.25}},{"label":"Most of it, with conditions","value":"Most of it, with conditions","weights":{"reparented":0.5}},{"label":"Almost all of it","value":"Almost all of it","weights":{"reparented":0.75}},{"label":"Whatever they wanted, and I would have had to make that make sense","value":"Whatever they wanted, and I would have had to make that make sense","weights":{"reparented":1}}]},{"id":"child-support","type":"choice","prompt":"When it shows up, who do you go to?","domain":"support","options":[{"label":"Nowhere — it stays mine","value":"Nowhere — it stays mine","weights":{"soothed":0}},{"label":"To a memory, usually","value":"To a memory, usually","weights":{"soothed":0.25}},{"label":"To alcohol, food, scrolling, or something similar","value":"To alcohol, food, scrolling, or something similar","weights":{"soothed":0.5}},{"label":"To one or two people, after a while","value":"To one or two people, after a while","weights":{"soothed":0.75}},{"label":"To someone who knows, and to myself as well","value":"To someone who knows, and to myself as well","weights":{"soothed":1}}]}]'::jsonb, '{"method":"weighted_sum_percentage","dimensions":["unexamined","recognised","soothed","reparented"],"primary_rule":"highest_sub_score"}'::jsonb, '[{"id":"unexamined","label":"Not examined","short":"It runs, unnamed","description":"The reactions are there and have never been looked at, which means there is nothing yet to work with. This is by far the most common position and carries no particular weight of its own.","shadow":"Reading the reaction as evidence about your character.","color":"slate","masters":["observation","self-inquiry"],"calibration":{"dimensions":{"emotion":0.25,"body":0.2,"thought":0.15},"practiceLevels":{"observation":1,"self-inquiry":1},"tags":["unexamined","unnoticed"]}},{"id":"recognised","label":"Recognised","short":"You can see it happening","description":"The small part can be identified in real time, which changes what happens next. Recognition is not the end of anything; it is generally the point at which people first find it harder, because it can now be felt as well as seen.","shadow":"Using recognition as somewhere to stop.","color":"rose","masters":["witnessing","self-inquiry"],"calibration":{"dimensions":{"emotion":0.3,"thought":0.2,"connection":0.15},"practiceLevels":{"witnessing":1,"self-inquiry":1},"domainStress":{"regression":"emotional-healing"},"tags":["recognised","visible"]}},{"id":"soothed","label":"Soothed","short":"It is answered, not managed","description":"The request is heard and met rather than argued with or buried. This is a real skill and it is mostly not the one adults are given — it is learned, and it takes a certain amount of deliberate attention to the body while it is happening.","shadow":"Comfort that postpones rather than settles.","color":"amber","masters":["emotional-healing","body"],"calibration":{"dimensions":{"emotion":0.3,"body":0.25,"connection":0.2},"practiceLevels":{"emotional-healing":1,"body":1},"domainStress":{"regulation":"health"},"tags":["soothed","met"]}},{"id":"reparented","label":"Reparented","short":"You are the adult it was waiting for","description":"The request is answered by the person you now are — present, adult, and able to actually do it. The old reaction still turns up; what has changed is that there is no longer any need for it to run the room.","shadow":"Attending to the small part as a way of not attending to the life.","color":"teal","masters":["emotional-healing","witnessing"],"calibration":{"dimensions":{"spirit":0.3,"emotion":0.25,"body":0.15},"practiceLevels":{"emotional-healing":2,"witnessing":1},"tags":["reparented","internally-held"]}}]'::jsonb, '{"loops_to_check":["regression","approval-seeking","self-criticism"],"practice_affinity":["emotional-healing","witnessing"],"deepens_with":["attachment-style","shadow-inventory","inner-council"]}'::jsonb, 1, true, false, 100, now())
