    ('spiritual-stage', 'Where you stand today', 'Your position on the path', 'vedic', 'stage', E'The path is a shape, not a ladder. It is not measured in years or in how much anyone knows about it — it is measured by what is actually possible for you at the moment, and that changes several times in a life.\n\nFive positions are described here. They are not grades and they are not permanent: the reading is a description of today, and most people have been in at least two of them already. Pick the one that is closest, not the one that sounds best.', '🧭', 6, 6, '[{"id":"stage-now","type":"choice","prompt":"If someone asked where you are on this path right now, what would you tell them?","domain":"position","options":[{"label":"Whatever happens is happening to me, and I meet it as it arrives","value":"Whatever happens is happening to me, and I meet it as it arrives","weights":{"sleeping":1}},{"label":"Something is clearly not right, and I keep asking what","value":"Something is clearly not right, and I keep asking what","weights":{"questioning":1}},{"label":"I can watch myself going through it while it is going on","value":"I can watch myself going through it while it is going on","weights":{"observing":1}},{"label":"What used to hurt is being turned into something I can use","value":"What used to hurt is being turned into something I can use","weights":{"alchemist":1}},{"label":"I can choose what happens next, and mostly I do","value":"I can choose what happens next, and mostly I do","weights":{"navigator":1}}]},{"id":"stage-body","type":"choice","prompt":"How much of what happens in a day is happening to you, rather than something you are taking part in?","domain":"share","options":[{"label":"Almost all of it happens to me","value":"Almost all of it happens to me","weights":{"sleeping":1,"questioning":0,"observing":0,"alchemist":0,"navigator":0}},{"label":"Most of it does","value":"Most of it does","weights":{"sleeping":0,"questioning":1,"observing":0,"alchemist":0,"navigator":0}},{"label":"About half of it","value":"About half of it","weights":{"sleeping":0,"questioning":0,"observing":1,"alchemist":0,"navigator":0}},{"label":"I am part of most of it","value":"I am part of most of it","weights":{"sleeping":0,"questioning":0,"observing":0,"alchemist":1,"navigator":0}},{"label":"Nearly everything I meet, I go out and meet","value":"Nearly everything I meet, I go out and meet","weights":{"sleeping":0,"questioning":0,"observing":0,"alchemist":0,"navigator":1}}]},{"id":"stage-marker","type":"choice","prompt":"What told you that something in you had changed, even if you could not say what?","domain":"signal","options":[{"label":"I noticed I was more affected by things than I used to be","value":"I noticed I was more affected by things than I used to be","weights":{"sleeping":1,"questioning":0,"observing":0,"alchemist":0,"navigator":0}},{"label":"I noticed I had started asking why things were the way they are","value":"I noticed I had started asking why things were the way they are","weights":{"sleeping":0,"questioning":1,"observing":0,"alchemist":0,"navigator":0}},{"label":"I noticed I could watch my own reaction while it was still happening","value":"I noticed I could watch my own reaction while it was still happening","weights":{"sleeping":0,"questioning":0,"observing":1,"alchemist":0,"navigator":0}},{"label":"I noticed something that used to hurt had become usable","value":"I noticed something that used to hurt had become usable","weights":{"sleeping":0,"questioning":0,"observing":0,"alchemist":1,"navigator":0}},{"label":"I noticed I was choosing again, on purpose, and enjoying it","value":"I noticed I was choosing again, on purpose, and enjoying it","weights":{"sleeping":0,"questioning":0,"observing":0,"alchemist":0,"navigator":1}}]},{"id":"stage-practice","type":"choice","prompt":"How much of your life is spent doubting one thing or another?","domain":"doubt","options":[{"label":"I am not really in doubt about much","value":"I am not really in doubt about much","weights":{"questioning":0}},{"label":"A little, about a few specific things","value":"A little, about a few specific things","weights":{"questioning":0.25}},{"label":"A fair amount, mostly about my direction","value":"A fair amount, mostly about my direction","weights":{"questioning":0.5}},{"label":"Most days, about most things","value":"Most days, about most things","weights":{"questioning":0.75}},{"label":"It has been years, and nothing still feels settled","value":"It has been years, and nothing still feels settled","weights":{"questioning":1}}]},{"id":"stage-blocked","type":"choice","prompt":"What is stopping you moving right now?","domain":"edge","options":[{"label":"I cannot see clearly enough to take a first step","value":"I cannot see clearly enough to take a first step","weights":{"sleeping":1}},{"label":"I can see it and I talk myself out of it","value":"I can see it and I talk myself out of it","weights":{"questioning":1}},{"label":"I can see it, but I cannot hold the seeing under pressure","value":"I can see it, but I cannot hold the seeing under pressure","weights":{"observing":1}},{"label":"I have started the work and it is taking nearly everything I have","value":"I have started the work and it is taking nearly everything I have","weights":{"alchemist":1}},{"label":"I can see the next step and something in me hesitates anyway","value":"I can see the next step and something in me hesitates anyway","weights":{"navigator":1}}]},{"id":"stage-return","type":"choice","prompt":"Would you go back to a year ago, if going back were possible?","domain":"return","options":[{"label":"Gladly, and I would not hesitate","value":"Gladly, and I would not hesitate","weights":{"sleeping":1,"observing":0,"navigator":0}},{"label":"Part of me would, and the rest would not","value":"Part of me would, and the rest would not","weights":{"sleeping":0,"observing":1,"navigator":0}},{"label":"Not for anything","value":"Not for anything","weights":{"sleeping":0,"observing":0,"navigator":1}}]}]'::jsonb, '{"method":"weighted_sum_percentage","dimensions":["sleeping","questioning","observing","alchemist","navigator"],"primary_rule":"highest_sub_score"}'::jsonb, '[{"id":"sleeping","label":"Sleeping","short":"Events still arrive as events","description":"Most of what happens still happens to you rather than being noticed happening. This is a position and not a verdict — the path has to be seen before it can be walked, and seeing it is usually the first genuine event of a life. What moves from here is not effort but attention.","shadow":"Reading the size of the reaction as the whole of what is available.","color":"slate","masters":["observation","body"],"calibration":{"dimensions":{"body":0.2,"emotion":0.2,"thought":0.15},"practiceLevels":{"observation":2,"body":1},"domainStress":{"stability":"health"},"tags":["unreflective","reactive"]}},{"id":"questioning","label":"Questioning","short":"Something is not right and it will not stay quiet","description":"The discrepancy has been noticed and it keeps reopening. Doubt is doing real work here, because the question has nowhere to land until it is asked properly. The risk is a loop rather than a movement, and the cure for a loop is not more analysis but something done consistently.","shadow":"Mistaking the restlessness of the search for the thing being searched for.","color":"amber","masters":["self-inquiry","observation"],"calibration":{"dimensions":{"thought":0.35,"emotion":0.2,"body":0.1},"practiceLevels":{"self-inquiry":2,"observation":1},"domainStress":{"direction":"self-inquiry"},"tags":["questioning","dissatisfied"]}},{"id":"observing","label":"Observing","short":"The watcher is running during the event","description":"There is a vantage point from which your own reactions are visible while they are happening. That is the whole mechanism, and it is more fragile than it looks — the common difficulty here is not the seeing but the staying, and sustainability is the real work.","shadow":"Reading the ability to watch as the same as having understood it.","color":"sky","masters":["witnessing","observation"],"calibration":{"dimensions":{"spirit":0.25,"thought":0.2,"body":0.15},"practiceLevels":{"witnessing":2},"tags":["watching","sustaining"]}},{"id":"alchemist","label":"Alchemist","short":"The pain is being worked on rather than survived","description":"The material that used to run you is being put through something and coming out different. It is heavy, unglamorous, and the most transformative part of the arc. What gives it away is not intensity but usefulness — the old material now does work in your life.","shadow":"Confusing the intensity of the process with its direction.","color":"violet","masters":["emotional-healing","kriya"],"calibration":{"dimensions":{"emotion":0.35,"spirit":0.2,"body":0.15},"practiceLevels":{"emotional-healing":1,"kriya":1},"domainStress":{"process":"emotional-healing"},"tags":["transforming","in-process"]}},{"id":"navigator","label":"Navigator","short":"Choice has become available, and is still being learned","description":"You can see the options and pick one, which sounds simple until you have done it. Freedom of this kind is disorienting rather than pleasant at first: every option taken is also a door closed, and the mind does not always accept the trade. The next difficulty is not more choice but the willingness to be responsible for it.","shadow":"Using the ability to choose to avoid choosing.","color":"emerald","masters":["raja","karma"],"calibration":{"dimensions":{"action":0.3,"spirit":0.2,"thought":0.15},"practiceLevels":{"raja":1,"karma":1},"domainStress":{"choice":"work-career"},"tags":["choosing","responsible"]}}]'::jsonb, '{"loops_to_check":["reactivity","approval-seeking"],"practice_affinity":["observation","self-inquiry","witnessing"],"deepens_with":["inner-compass","witness-capacity"]}'::jsonb, 1, true, false, 100, now())
